window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They're hers to keep, and she's theirs to cherish, but sometimes, that just isn't enough....</b></p> <p>Thanks to one small accident that changed everything, Sascha's life is on the brink of implosion. She has her men at her back, but when one of her lovers decides to go rogue, it could ultimately destroy their relationship.</p> <p>She's always has their hearts, but what about their heads? That they cherish her was never in doubt, but can Sascha's men can give her what she needs?</p> <p>With their world in flux, she'll need a lot more than cherishing....</p>"; 
